  "summary": "设计简化数据库：多张固定列数表支持插入行、按行号删除，以及按表名、行号、列号查询单元格。",
  "insight": "每张表用动态行数组保存，数组下标加一就是只增不复用的 rowId。删除只把对应槽位标记为空，不改变后续行号。",
  "pitfalls": [
    "每张表行号独立从一开始",
    "删除行号不会被复用",
    "列号也从一开始"
  ],
  "solutions": [
    {
      "id": "per-table-append-only-row-slots",
      "title": "每表只增行槽位",
      "kind": "最优",
      "idea": "保留删除占位以稳定行号。",
      "steps": [
        "构造 name→rows 空列表",
        "insertRow 追加 row 副本",
        "deleteRow 把 rows[rowId-1] 置空",
        "selectCell 返回 rows[rowId-1][columnId-1]"
      ],
      "complexity": {
        "time": "O(columns) 插入，O(1) 删除查询",
        "space": "O(total inserted cells)"
      },
      "files": {
        "java": "solutions/per-table-append-only-row-slots/Solution.java",
        "kotlin": "solutions/per-table-append-only-row-slots/Solution.kt",
        "cpp": "solutions/per-table-append-only-row-slots/solution.cpp"
      }
    }
  ]
